0;Skip Intro;Skip the first cinematic and help gui;1
1;Skip Start-up Menu (Reset);Skip the start-up menu when resetting;1
2;Skip Start-up Menu (New Game);Skip the start-up menu when starting a new game;1
3;Skip Player Custom (Reset);Keep the current player class/color when resetting;1
4;Skip Player Custom (New Game);Keep the current player class/color when starting a new game;1
5;Skip Difficulty Selection (Reset);Keep the current difficulty when resetting;1
6;Skip Difficulty Selection (New Game);Keep the current difficuty when starting a new game;1
7;Moves per press (IF kitty protocol isn't supported);Sets the number of moves triggered by one key press (0: default);3
8;Skip Kitty Warning;Skips the kitty unsupported warning and moves per press selection;1